{"parse": {"title": "种瓜得瓜-07", "pageid": 93760, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%8D%E7%93%9C%E5%BE%97%E7%93%9C-06\" title=\"种瓜得瓜-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">种瓜得瓜-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%8D%E7%93%9C%E5%BE%97%E7%93%9C-08\" title=\"种瓜得瓜-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">种瓜得瓜</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9B.A8.E6.B0.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"雨水\">雨水</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 雨水</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Rain Water</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>呃……这里是开关吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-311010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-311010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-311010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>噢，红灯亮了，那看来应该是开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>咳……咳咳，这里是梁月警员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>呃……我现在在洛城最大的游乐场，今天的天气，晴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>今日的指标是完成史上最惊险的过山车和鬼屋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>嗯，请不要告诉我的爸爸妈妈，免得他们担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……这里是梁月警员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>是的，洛城最出名的占卜酒吧，其老板是一名著名神秘学魔术师，据说她只需看顾客一眼就能调配出令对方流连忘返的美酒来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>接下来，我会品尝一口并报告我的尝试体验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>这里是梁月警员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>嘘，压低声音通话是必须的，因为我正在参加一场简朴而庄严的西式葬礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>老人寿终正寝。我希望我与我身边的人也会如此。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_tiankong1\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_tiankong1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_tiankong1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>嗨，这里是梁月警员。我现在正在回国的飞机上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>鉴于我们之前对彼此都没有深入地了解，我认为互相分享生活不失为一种良性互动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>虽然我暂时还没有收到回信——但我对即将到来的一切充满期待。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanshuangrenjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>喂？妈妈，是的，飞机可能会延误两个小时，晚饭我就不回来吃了。<br />你们按照原定时间往后推两个小时再来接我吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>是的，航班243号我没有弄错，他们永远会临时通知延误情况。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_fanzuike1\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_fanzuike1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_fanzuike1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div><i>“祝你一路顺风！”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>怎么样，这是我新学的中文，看来发音倒是也不难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>长官，您说得很标准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>只是我不敢保证是否有任何罪犯的专属神秘术发动条件是——突然说出一段他并不熟知的非母语词句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃尔登警长：</div><div>记仇。哈，是我带出来的好警察。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>梁，如果拿到了执夜人佩戴的徽章，一定要第一时间告诉我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她对波蒂埃眨了眨眼，而后深深环顾了一下四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>大家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梁月对着与自己共事许久的同事敬了一个悠久的礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而在她的面前，那些肤色各异的同事们，也向她回以最庄重的军礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众警察：</div><div><i>“祝你一路顺风！”</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_zhiciyuanzhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_zhiciyuanzhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_zhiciyuanzhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-1_6_bg_zhiciyuanzhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_zhiciyuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-1_6_bg_zhiciyuanzhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_zhiciyuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-1_6_bg_zhiciyuanzhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_zhiciyuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>我们以前经常来这里玩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>在这里左转，以前有一个锁匠。妈妈说他们家发了财，现在举家搬走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>事情变得很快，强梁，即便我们只离开了半年。这座小城发展得超乎我们想象。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>看，我们回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“有神衔蛇操蛇，其状虎首人身，四蹏长肘，名曰彊良。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“强梁、祖明，共食磔死寄生。强梁即彊良，古字通也。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>若有幸者，降天雷而不屈、受凌戮而不竭，可驰煌火而星流，逐赤疫于四裔</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">即 开 万 世 太 平</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>这是商周时期以金文写成、记载上古时代诸事的文献。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>它残缺严重，要重新修复它并不是易事。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>百年来，它束之高阁。<br />现在这个家里除了我和你之外，再没有人知道这文献的存在。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>你，你是个意外。误打误撞找到了这本书。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>而我……我是负责改写这本书的人。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>这上面记录着，能够真正唤醒强梁的古老仪式。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>也记录着，从百年前开始梁家所有接受历练者的名单。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>他们中有些人，天资难抵巫舞的虚耗，经年累月地调养才能得到缓解。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>也有些人，即便治愈，也会留下后遗症。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爷爷：</div><div><i>所以，爷爷再问你一次，你当真好奇这里头写了些什么吗？</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_at_kandianshi2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_at_kandianshi2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_5_at_kandianshi2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-2_5_at_kandianshi2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_5_at_kandianshi2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"320\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-2_5_at_kandianshi2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_5_at_kandianshi2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/Cg-2_5_at_kandianshi2_zone.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_at_kandianshi2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2024\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>明一支素烛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>春雷惊百虫，万物始生长。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>于沉香木的黑漆雕花衣箱子中取出一身祭服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-311016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>原来时间过去这么久，有些记不清强梁现世那年的情景了。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>披褂在身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-311020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-311020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-311020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>爸爸，爷爷，我和你们想的好像不太一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>头戴傩倛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-311020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-311020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-311020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>我觉得，它不是转瞬即逝的祝福或诅咒，也不是那场祖祖辈辈淋过的雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切妥当。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>它只是它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>是我们从未真正了解过的它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>立于天井，面朝神龛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>关于它怎么想，它为什么选中我，它是如何看待我的——这些，我都想从它嘴里亲自听到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>这一次，不是它选择我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>这一次，我想选择它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">仪 式 的 第 一 步</span><br /><span style=\"font-size:400%\">祭器</span><br /><br />仓庚止息，草木伏地</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">仪 式 的 第 二 步</span><br /><span style=\"font-size:400%\">祭司</span><br /><br />鼎炉升烟，昭穆煌煌</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:100%\">仪 式 的 第 三 步</span><br /><span style=\"font-size:400%\">咒语</span><br /><br />南北东西，骤风漫浪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311022.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-311022.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311022.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311022.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-311022.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311022.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-311022.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311022.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>仪式的第四步……</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:400%\"><span style=\"color:#C81414\">血</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>物无非彼，物无非是。<br />自彼则不见，自知则知之。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_at_summon.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_at_summon\"><img alt=\"2_5_at_summon\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/Cg-2_5_at_summon.png/600px-Cg-2_5_at_summon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/Cg-2_5_at_summon.png/900px-Cg-2_5_at_summon.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/Cg-2_5_at_summon.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_at_summon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>如果你真的从这个世界上消失了……</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div><i>那么我可以再次向你发起叩问吗？</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>诡异的手势形同傩舞，电光石火自流血的指间翻飞而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天雷齐喑，银线火蛇沿着青瓦白墙游走，穹顶向着大地庞然俯身而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>残夔魖与罔像，殪野仲而歼游光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>八灵为之震慴，况鬾蛊与毕方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>强梁既出，罔有不韪。斩杀凶咎，枭截不祥！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>                                                                                                          第七節 雨水</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "种瓜得瓜-07"}}